From: UOS Deepin Podman Maintainers <uos-maintainers@uniontech.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0800
Subject: rootless: preserve systemd socket activation fds across re-exec

When podman.service is socket-activated at user login and races with the
other podman units to set up the rootless pause process, the re-executed
child can lose the race for the pause PID file and fall back to
reexec_userns_join(), which forks again.

The parent of reexec_in_user_namespace() used to close the LISTEN_FDS
socket (fd 3) before this fallback, so the final child inherited a stale
fd 3 (the CLOEXEC user-namespace handle) and the journald datagram socket
then reused fd 3.  The API service tried to accept(2) on a datagram
socket and failed with "accept4: operation not supported".

Move the close out of reexec_in_user_namespace() into a new
close_systemd_activation_fds() helper that the parent calls only after
the pause PID race is resolved.  On the success path the fds are still
closed so they are not leaked for the lifetime of the child; on the
race-lost path they stay open so reexec_userns_join() can hand them to
the final child.

---
 pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.c  | 31 ++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.go |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.c b/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.c
index ddb97b3..6f8308b 100644
--- a/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.c
+++ b/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.c
@@ -947,6 +947,26 @@ check_proc_sys_userns_file (const char *path)
     }
 }
 
+int
+close_systemd_activation_fds (void)
+{
+  if (do_socket_activation)
+    {
+      long num_fds;
+
+      num_fds = strtol (saved_systemd_listen_fds, NULL, 10);
+      if (num_fds != LONG_MIN && num_fds != LONG_MAX)
+        {
+          int f;
+
+          for (f = 3; f < num_fds + 3; f++)
+            if (is_fd_inherited (f))
+              close (f);
+        }
+    }
+  return 0;
+}
+
 int
 reexec_in_user_namespace (int ready, char *pause_pid_file_path)
 {
@@ -981,17 +1001,6 @@ reexec_in_user_namespace (int ready, char *pause_pid_file_path)
     {
       if (do_socket_activation)
         {
-          long num_fds;
-
-          num_fds = strtol (saved_systemd_listen_fds, NULL, 10);
-          if (num_fds != LONG_MIN && num_fds != LONG_MAX)
-            {
-              int f;
-
-              for (f = 3; f < num_fds + 3; f++)
-                if (is_fd_inherited (f))
-                  close (f);
-            }
           unsetenv ("LISTEN_PID");
           unsetenv ("LISTEN_FDS");
           unsetenv ("LISTEN_FDNAMES");
diff --git a/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.go b/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.go
index 3ad3906..e03a03b 100644
--- a/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.go
+++ b/pkg/rootless/rootless_linux.go
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ extern int reexec_in_user_namespace(int ready, char *pause_pid_file_path);
 extern int reexec_in_user_namespace_wait(int pid, int options);
 extern int reexec_userns_join(int pid, char *pause_pid_file_path);
 extern int is_fd_inherited(int fd);
+extern int close_systemd_activation_fds(void);
 */
 import "C"
 
@@ -373,6 +374,7 @@ func becomeRootInUserNS(pausePid string) (_ bool, _ int, retErr error) {
 		return false, -1, errors.New("setting up the process")
 	}
 
+	C.close_systemd_activation_fds()
 	return waitAndProxySignalsToChild(pidC)
 }
 
